OL,3,GNEWSAAxed bus service partly replaced
OL,4,Aby rival company
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rival bus company is partly replacing
OL,7,Fone of the routes between Kent and
OL,8,FLondon that is being cut by National
OL,9,FExpress.
OL,11,FGoBus, based in Swanley, has announced
OL,12,Fits new Kentish Express 007 service
OL,13,Fwill serve Canterbury, Faversham,
OL,14,FChatham, Gillingham, Bluewater, Bexley
OL,15,Fand North Greenwich's Underground
OL,16,Fstation in London.
OL,18,FNational Express had said its Dover 007
OL,19,Fand Ramsgate 022 routes, run by its
OL,20,Fpartner The Coach Travel Group, were no
OL,21,Flonger commercially sustainable.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
